{
    "openapi": "3.1.0",
    "info": {
        "title": "HealthAI - Service de Recommandation Nutritionnelle",
        "description": "\n## Service de recommandation nutritionnelle \u00e2\u20ac\u201d HealthAI Coach\n\nMicro-service FastAPI exposant deux fonctionnalit\u00c3\u00a9s principales :\n\n### Analyse de repas (`/api/nutrition/analyze`)\n- D\u00c3\u00a9tection des aliments via le mod\u00c3\u00a8le de vision **nateraw/food** (ViT, Food-101)\n- Calcul des macronutriments via l'API **USDA FoodData Central**\n- D\u00c3\u00a9tection des d\u00c3\u00a9s\u00c3\u00a9quilibres nutritionnels via un mod\u00c3\u00a8le **Random Forest** (scikit-learn)\n- G\u00c3\u00a9n\u00c3\u00a9ration de recommandations textuelles personnalis\u00c3\u00a9es selon l'objectif et le r\u00c3\u00a9gime de l'utilisateur\n\n### Plan de repas (`/api/meal-plan/generate`)\n- G\u00c3\u00a9n\u00c3\u00a9ration d'un plan sur 1 \u00c3\u00a0 7 jours\n- Filtrage automatique des allerg\u00c3\u00a8nes et respect du r\u00c3\u00a9gime alimentaire\n- Persistance de l'historique en **MongoDB**\n\n### Authentification\nToutes les routes n\u00c3\u00a9cessitent un token JWT Bearer g\u00c3\u00a9n\u00c3\u00a9r\u00c3\u00a9 par l'API principale (Express).\n",
        "contact": {
            "name": "HealthAI Coach"
        },
        "license": {
            "name": "Projet p\u00c3\u00a9dagogique EPSI \u00e2\u20ac\u201d MSPR TPRE502"
        },
        "version": "1.0.0"
    },
    "paths": {
        "/api/nutrition/analyze": {
            "post": {
                "tags": [
                    "Analyse Nutritionnelle"
                ],
                "summary": "Analyze Meal",
                "description": "Analyse une photo de repas pour l'utilisateur connect\u00c3\u00a9.\nSon profil sant\u00c3\u00a9 et ses allergies sont r\u00c3\u00a9cup\u00c3\u00a9r\u00c3\u00a9s automatiquement depuis PostgreSQL.\nRetourne les aliments d\u00c3\u00a9tect\u00c3\u00a9s, les valeurs nutritionnelles et les recommandations personnalis\u00c3\u00a9es.",
                "operationId": "analyze_meal_api_nutrition_analyze_post",
                "requestBody": {
                    "content": {
                        "multipart/form-data": {
                            "schema": {
                                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Body_analyze_meal_api_nutrition_analyze_post"
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "required": true
                },
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "Successful Response",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MealAnalysisResponse"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "422": {
                        "description": "Validation Error",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                },
                "security": [
                    {
                        "HTTPBearer": []
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        "/api/meal-plan/generate": {
            "post": {
                "tags": [
                    "Plans de Repas"
                ],
                "summary": "Generate Meal Plan",
                "description": "G\u00c3\u00a9n\u00c3\u00a8re un plan de repas pour l'utilisateur connect\u00c3\u00a9.\nSon profil sant\u00c3\u00a9, r\u00c3\u00a9gime et allergies sont r\u00c3\u00a9cup\u00c3\u00a9r\u00c3\u00a9s automatiquement depuis PostgreSQL.",
                "operationId": "generate_meal_plan_api_meal_plan_generate_post",
                "requestBody": {
                    "content": {
                        "application/json": {
                            "schema": {
                                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MealPlanRequest"
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "required": true
                },
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "Successful Response",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MealPlanResponse"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "422": {
                        "description": "Validation Error",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                },
                "security": [
                    {
                        "HTTPBearer": []
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        "/api/meal-plan/history": {
            "get": {
                "tags": [
                    "Plans de Repas"
                ],
                "summary": "Get History",
                "description": "Historique global de tous les plans g\u00c3\u00a9n\u00c3\u00a9r\u00c3\u00a9s. R\u00c3\u00a9serv\u00c3\u00a9 aux admins.",
                "operationId": "get_history_api_meal_plan_history_get",
                "security": [
                    {
                        "HTTPBearer": []
                    }
                ],
                "parameters": [
                    {
                        "name": "limit",
                        "in": "query",
                        "required": false,
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "integer",
                            "default": 10,
                            "title": "Limit"
                        }
                    }
                ],
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "Successful Response",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {}
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "422": {
                        "description": "Validation Error",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "/api/meal-plan/user/{user_id}": {
            "get": {
                "tags": [
                    "Plans de Repas"
                ],
                "summary": "Get User Plans",
                "description": "Retourne les plans de repas d'un utilisateur.\nUn utilisateur ne peut consulter que ses propres plans.",
                "operationId": "get_user_plans_api_meal_plan_user__user_id__get",
                "security": [
                    {
                        "HTTPBearer": []
                    }
                ],
                "parameters": [
                    {
                        "name": "user_id",
                        "in": "path",
                        "required": true,
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "integer",
                            "title": "User Id"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "limit",
                        "in": "query",
                        "required": false,
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "integer",
                            "default": 10,
                            "title": "Limit"
                        }
                    }
                ],
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "Successful Response",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {}
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "422": {
                        "description": "Validation Error",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "/health": {
            "get": {
                "summary": "Health Check",
                "operationId": "health_check_health_get",
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "Successful Response",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {}
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "/": {
            "get": {
                "summary": "Root",
                "operationId": "root__get",
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "Successful Response",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {}
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    },
    "components": {
        "schemas": {
            "Body_analyze_meal_api_nutrition_analyze_post": {
                "properties": {
                    "image": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "contentMediaType": "application/octet-stream",
                        "title": "Image",
                        "description": "Photo du repas (jpg, png, webp)"
                    }
                },
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                    "image"
                ],
                "title": "Body_analyze_meal_api_nutrition_analyze_post"
            },
            "DayPlan": {
                "properties": {
                    "day": {
                        "type": "integer",
                        "title": "Day"
                    },
                    "meals": {
                        "items": {
                            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Meal"
                        },
                        "type": "array",
                        "title": "Meals"
                    },
                    "total_calories": {
                        "type": "number",
                        "title": "Total Calories"
                    }
                },
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                    "day",
                    "meals",
                    "total_calories"
                ],
                "title": "DayPlan"
            },
            "DietEnum": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                    "vegan",
                    "vegetarian",
                    "pescatarian",
                    "gluten_free",
                    "lactose_free",
                    "halal",
                    "kosher",
                    "none"
                ],
                "title": "DietEnum"
            },
            "FoodItem": {
                "properties": {
                    "name": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "title": "Name"
                    },
                    "confidence": {
                        "type": "number",
                        "title": "Confidence"
                    },
                    "portion_g": {
                        "type": "number",
                        "title": "Portion G",
                        "default": 100.0
                    },
                    "calories": {
                        "anyOf": [
                            {
                                "type": "number"
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "null"
                            }
                        ],
                        "title": "Calories"
                    },
                    "protein_g": {
                        "anyOf": [
                            {
                                "type": "number"
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "null"
                            }
                        ],
                        "title": "Protein G"
                    },
                    "carbs_g": {
                        "anyOf": [
                            {
                                "type": "number"
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "null"
                            }
                        ],
                        "title": "Carbs G"
                    },
                    "fat_g": {
                        "anyOf": [
                            {
                                "type": "number"
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "null"
                            }
                        ],
                        "title": "Fat G"
                    }
                },
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                    "name",
                    "confidence"
                ],
                "title": "FoodItem"
            },
            "HTTPValidationError": {
                "properties": {
                    "detail": {
                        "items": {
                            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ValidationError"
                        },
                        "type": "array",
                        "title": "Detail"
                    }
                },
                "type": "object",
                "title": "HTTPValidationError"
            },
            "Meal": {
                "properties": {
                    "name": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "title": "Name"
                    },
                    "type": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "title": "Type"
                    },
                    "foods": {
                        "items": {
                            "type": "string"
                        },
                        "type": "array",
                        "title": "Foods"
                    },
                    "estimated_calories": {
                        "type": "number",
                        "title": "Estimated Calories"
                    },
                    "prep_time_min": {
                        "type": "integer",
                        "title": "Prep Time Min"
                    }
                },
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                    "name",
                    "type",
                    "foods",
                    "estimated_calories",
                    "prep_time_min"
                ],
                "title": "Meal"
            },
            "MealAnalysisResponse": {
                "properties": {
                    "detected_foods": {
                        "items": {
                            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/FoodItem"
                        },
                        "type": "array",
                        "title": "Detected Foods"
                    },
                    "total_calories": {
                        "type": "number",
                        "title": "Total Calories"
                    },
                    "target_calories": {
                        "anyOf": [
                            {
                                "type": "number"
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "null"
                            }
                        ],
                        "title": "Target Calories"
                    },
                    "total_protein_g": {
                        "type": "number",
                        "title": "Total Protein G"
                    },
                    "total_carbs_g": {
                        "type": "number",
                        "title": "Total Carbs G"
                    },
                    "total_fat_g": {
                        "type": "number",
                        "title": "Total Fat G"
                    },
                    "imbalances": {
                        "items": {
                            "type": "string"
                        },
                        "type": "array",
                        "title": "Imbalances"
                    },
                    "suggestions": {
                        "items": {
                            "type": "string"
                        },
                        "type": "array",
                        "title": "Suggestions"
                    },
                    "macros_ratios": {
                        "additionalProperties": true,
                        "type": "object",
                        "title": "Macros Ratios"
                    },
                    "ml_label": {
                        "anyOf": [
                            {
                                "type": "string"
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "null"
                            }
                        ],
                        "title": "Ml Label"
                    },
                    "ml_confidence": {
                        "anyOf": [
                            {
                                "type": "number"
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "null"
                            }
                        ],
                        "title": "Ml Confidence"
                    }
                },
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                    "detected_foods",
                    "total_calories",
                    "total_protein_g",
                    "total_carbs_g",
                    "total_fat_g",
                    "imbalances",
                    "suggestions",
                    "macros_ratios"
                ],
                "title": "MealAnalysisResponse"
            },
            "MealPlanRequest": {
                "properties": {
                    "days": {
                        "type": "integer",
                        "title": "Days",
                        "default": 7
                    },
                    "meals_per_day": {
                        "type": "integer",
                        "title": "Meals Per Day",
                        "default": 3
                    }
                },
                "type": "object",
                "title": "MealPlanRequest"
            },
            "MealPlanResponse": {
                "properties": {
                    "user_id": {
                        "type": "integer",
                        "title": "User Id"
                    },
                    "user_profile": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/UserProfile"
                    },
                    "plan": {
                        "items": {
                            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/DayPlan"
                        },
                        "type": "array",
                        "title": "Plan"
                    },
                    "weekly_notes": {
                        "items": {
                            "type": "string"
                        },
                        "type": "array",
                        "title": "Weekly Notes"
                    }
                },
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                    "user_id",
                    "user_profile",
                    "plan",
                    "weekly_notes"
                ],
                "title": "MealPlanResponse"
            },
            "ObjectiveEnum": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                    "weight_loss",
                    "muscle_gain",
                    "endurance",
                    "maintenance"
                ],
                "title": "ObjectiveEnum"
            },
            "UserProfile": {
                "properties": {
                    "objective": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ObjectiveEnum",
                        "default": "maintenance"
                    },
                    "gender": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "title": "Gender",
                        "default": "male"
                    },
                    "age": {
                        "anyOf": [
                            {
                                "type": "integer"
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "null"
                            }
                        ],
                        "title": "Age"
                    },
                    "weight_kg": {
                        "anyOf": [
                            {
                                "type": "number"
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "null"
                            }
                        ],
                        "title": "Weight Kg"
                    },
                    "height_cm": {
                        "anyOf": [
                            {
                                "type": "number"
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "null"
                            }
                        ],
                        "title": "Height Cm"
                    },
                    "diet": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/DietEnum",
                        "default": "none"
                    },
                    "allergies": {
                        "items": {
                            "type": "string"
                        },
                        "type": "array",
                        "title": "Allergies",
                        "default": []
                    },
                    "budget": {
                        "anyOf": [
                            {
                                "type": "string"
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "null"
                            }
                        ],
                        "title": "Budget"
                    }
                },
                "type": "object",
                "title": "UserProfile"
            },
            "ValidationError": {
                "properties": {
                    "loc": {
                        "items": {
                            "anyOf": [
                                {
                                    "type": "string"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "integer"
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        "type": "array",
                        "title": "Location"
                    },
                    "msg": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "title": "Message"
                    },
                    "type": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "title": "Error Type"
                    },
                    "input": {
                        "title": "Input"
                    },
                    "ctx": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "title": "Context"
                    }
                },
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                    "loc",
                    "msg",
                    "type"
                ],
                "title": "ValidationError"
            }
        },
        "securitySchemes": {
            "HTTPBearer": {
                "type": "http",
                "scheme": "bearer"
            }
        }
    }
}
